    {
      "id": "biz",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 380,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Business card — for people who have NOT hired her yet.\n3.5 x 2in trim (336 x 192px at 96ppi).\n\nNo QR: the domain is already printed, so a QR to the same\nplace is redundant. Removing it let the back breathe.\nNo \"Insured\" line until the PSA policy is bound."
    },
    {
      "id": "ty",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 380,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Thank-you leave-behind — given AFTER a completed job,\nwhen the client is happiest. This is the card that earns\nthe 15-25 Google reviews before November.\n\nThe ruled line is for Anna to handwrite the pet's name.\nThat handwriting is the point — don't set it in type."
    },
    {
      "id": "qr",
      "x": 480,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 380,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "QR encodes annabelspetcare.com/review — a redirect page\nin the repo that we control, NOT a Google URL.\n\nSo this card can print before the GMB exists. When the\nprofile verifies, paste the Google review link into\nREVIEW_URL in review/index.html and push. No reprint."
    },
